  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/09/IMG_2737.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El Grup Folcl&ograve;ric d&#39;Onda ha celebrat aquest primer dissabte de setembre la seua festa anual, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5srJ6TfrpA\" target=\"_blank\">amb ofrena de flors a la seua patrona Santa B&agrave;rbera</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/09/IMG_2754.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TofiA4JsHKU\" target=\"_blank\">Despr&eacute;s han cantat i ballat durant la celebraci&oacute; de la missa a l&#39;esgl&eacute;sia de la Verge del Carme</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric18/img_2697.jpg\" alt=\"img_2697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric18/img_2698.jpg\" alt=\"img_2698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric18/img_2699.jpg\" alt=\"img_2699\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric18/img_2701.jpg\" alt=\"img_2701\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric18/img_2702.jpg\" alt=\"img_2702\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric18/img_2703.jpg\" alt=\"img_2703\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric18/img_2704.jpg\" alt=\"img_2704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2